      237.26,
      555.35,
      759.7
    ],
    "text": "PLEASE BE AWARE! The Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cArnab\u201d over the Bay of Bengal has crossed the Andra Pradesh coast and weaken into a Cyclonic Storm. It was located at Coastal Andra Pradesh and lay centered near Latitude 17.0\u00b0N and Longitude 81.7\u00b0E at 5.30 p.m. of today, the 28 October 2026. It is very likely to move North-northwestwards during next 24 hours and weaken gradually. It will weaken into a Deep Depression around 11.30pm today. The wind speed in the sea areas marked under the \u201cAdvisory\u201d category on the map below will increase to (55-65) kmph at times and those sea areas will be rough or very rough at times. The warning issued to prevent multi-day fishing boats and naval activities in the deep southwest Bay of Bengal Sea areas is withdrawn.",
